<title>USA: EastGroup sells 1.25 mln shares.</title>
<headline>EastGroup sells 1.25 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>EastGroup Properties said Tuesday that it sold 1,250,000 shares of beneficial interest under an existing shelf registration statement to institutional investors, with PaineWebber Group Inc acting as sole underwriter for the offering.</p>
<p>The net proceeds of the offering -- about $32,775,000, net of underwriting commissions and expenses -- will be used for the repayment of about $30,000,000 of outstanding indebtedness and to fund working capital requirements, including the acquisition of industrial properties, it said.</p>
</text>
